
ewmseedarchiver:

Read MSEED messages from an Earthworm transport ring and write the 
miniSEED records to the file system in flexible file layout.

See the ewmseedarchiver.d file for further description of options.

Open archive files are synchronized with the file system every hour by
default.  Configure this with "FlushInterval" (seconds); set it to 0 to
disable periodic synchronization.  Include the defining flag "%H" in an
Archive path when separate hourly files are desired.
